### Create insured
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/insureds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Carlo",
  "lastName": "Garibuldi",
  "documentNumber": "DOC-2",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-17",
  "email": "carlo@example.com",
  "phone": "+1 555 123 4567",
  "address": {
    "street": "123 Main St",
    "city": "Springfield",
    "state": "IL",
    "postalCode": "62701",
    "country": "USA"
  },
  "licenseNumber": "DL-998877",
  "licenseIssueDate": "2010-06-01"
}

### Get insured by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/insureds/3

### List insureds (paged)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/insureds?page=0&size=20&sort=lastName,asc

### Update insured
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/insureds/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane edt",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "documentNumber": "DOC-1",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-17",
  "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "phone": "+1 555 123 4567",
  "address": {
    "street": "456 Oak Ave",
    "city": "Springfield",
    "state": "IL",
    "postalCode": "62702",
    "country": "USA"
  },
  "licenseNumber": "DL-998877",
  "licenseIssueDate": "2010-06-01"
}

### Delete insured
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/insureds/4

### Catalog step 1-2: makes for a vehicle type
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicle-catalog/makes?vehicleType=CAR

### Catalog step 3: models of a make
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicle-catalog/models?vehicleType=CAR&make=Toyota

### Catalog step 4: versions of a model (each one is a catalog entry with its id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicle-catalog/versions?vehicleType=CAR&make=Toyota&model=Corolla

### Get catalog entry by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicle-catalog/2

### Catalog step 5: current valuation per year of a catalog entry (send its id as valuationId)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicle-catalog/2/valuations

### Create vehicle for an insured
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/insureds/5/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valuationId": 455,
  "licensePlate": "ABC-124"
}

### Get vehicle by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/insureds/5/vehicles/1

### List vehicles of an insured (paged)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/insureds/5/vehicles?page=0&size=20&sort=licensePlate,asc

### Update vehicle (change plate and/or selected valuation)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/insureds/5/vehicles/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valuationId": 21,
  "licensePlate": "ABC-125"
}

### Delete vehicle
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/insureds/5/vehicles/1

### Localities for a postal code (each one with its zone)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/localities?postalCode=2000

### Get locality by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/localities/1

### Quotation (quotes every plan: CIVIL_LIABILITY, THIRD_PARTY_EXTENDED, FULL_COVERAGE)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valuationId": 503,
  "birthDate": "2004-05-01",
  "localityId": 2378
}
